"Come to me, all who labor and are heavy laden, and I will give you rest." Jesus' invitation hasn't expired, even when our calendars are overflowing.

## 1. Start small

Five quiet minutes with Scripture is better than an hour you never take.

## 2. Practice Sabbath

Pick a window each week to stop, rest, and enjoy God's good gifts.
